## Air defence console buttons (their titles are the buttons' labels)

tip-console-tracks = The track list
tip-console-site = Launchers, missiles, stockpile and reloads
tip-console-lock = Lock the selected track: the camera follows it
tip-console-drop = Drop the lock (guided missiles go semi-active)
tip-console-guided = The radar guides the next missiles: hard to decoy, one target at a time
tip-console-semi = The next missiles home on the radar's illumination: several targets, easier to decoy; guided missiles in the air go semi-active
tip-console-fire = A missile (a Gepard: a burst) at the locked track
tip-console-launcher = Fire from this launcher; again: the readiest
tip-console-refill = Reload the empty launcher from the stockpile (4 min)
tip-console-flir = Thermal or colour camera picture
tip-console-zoom = Camera zoom
tip-console-range = The air picture's range
tip-console-leave = Leave the console: back to operations
tip-console-auto = The selected drone flies its route again
tip-console-manual = Fly the selected drone by hand: the stick and the throttle
tip-console-track = Hold the drone's camera on the ground at its crosshair
tip-console-slave = The drone's camera back to its waypoint (ahead and down)
tip-console-view = The drone's camera: its TGP, or the FLIR looking ahead to fly it by

## Controls

tip-hud-nav = NAV mode
    .desc = HUD navigation mode: steering to the current waypoint
tip-hud-air = AIR mode (A-A)
    .desc = HUD air-to-air mode: aircraft targets
tip-hud-gnd = GND mode (A-G)
    .desc = HUD air-to-ground mode: ground targets; again: CCIP / CCRP
tip-left-mfd = Left MFD
tip-cam-cycle = Tracking camera direction
    .desc = Next direction: ahead, right, rear, left
tip-on-off = On / off. { $detail }

## Lamps (their titles are the lamps' labels)

tip-lamp-stall = Airspeed below stall speed (blinks)
tip-lamp-trak = An enemy radar tracks the aircraft
tip-lamp-ir = An infrared missile is in flight
tip-lamp-rad = A radar-guided missile is in flight
tip-lamp-fire = Fire on board
tip-lamp-eng = Engine damage
tip-lamp-fc = Fire control damage
tip-lamp-jam = Jammer damage: ECM and IRJ fail
tip-lamp-av = Avionics damage
tip-lamp-fuel = Fuel system damage
tip-lamp-bd = Bay door damage: the doors stay open
tip-lamp-chaff-act = Chaff released
    .desc = Lights when chaff is released
tip-lamp-flare-act = Flare released
    .desc = Lights when a flare is released
tip-lamp-decoy-act = Decoy released
    .desc = Lights when a decoy is released
tip-lamp-emv-warn = EMV warning
    .desc = EMV: lit for 2 s after each radar detection
tip-lamp-low-fuel = Blinks below 1500 lbs of fuel

## LED counters, instruments, displays

tip-led-chaff = Chaff
    .desc = Chaff left
tip-led-flares = Flares
    .desc = Flares left
tip-led-decoys = Decoys
    .desc = Decoys left
tip-led-fuel = Fuel
    .desc = Fuel in lbs divided by 10
tip-led-thrust = Thrust
    .desc = Thrust in percent
tip-gear-lights = Gear lights
    .desc = A green lamp at each wheel while the gear is down
tip-dial-airspeed = Airspeed indicator
tip-dial-altimeter = Altimeter
tip-dial-aoa = AOA indicator
    .desc = Angle of attack; the approach band is green
tip-dial-vvi = Vertical velocity indicator
tip-dial-rpm = RPM
    .desc = Engine speed
tip-dial-ftit = FTIT
    .desc = Fan turbine inlet temperature
tip-dial-oil = Oil pressure
tip-dial-nozzle = Nozzle position
tip-dial-fuel = Fuel quantity
tip-dial-clock = Clock
    .desc = Local time
tip-dial-nozzle-angle = Nozzle angle
    .desc = Down from aft: 90° hover, 98.5° braking
tip-radar-bars = EGR / EAR
    .desc = Radar bar graph: enemy radar signal against the aircraft's EMV
tip-display-left = Left MFD
    .desc = Multifunction display
tip-display-centre = Centre display
    .desc = The right MFD's pages
tip-display-centre-mfd = Centre MFD
    .desc = The right MFD's pages
tip-display-right = Right MFD
    .desc = Multifunction display
tip-display-third = Third MFD
    .desc = Starts on the HSI page
tip-display-adi = Attitude indicator
    .desc = Pitch and bank
tip-display-approach = AOA indexer
    .desc = Slow: red top chevron, on speed: green circle, fast: amber bottom chevron
tip-display-rwr = RWR
    .desc = Radar warning receiver: the radars that see the aircraft
tip-display-tfr = Terrain following radar
    .desc = Range across, angle up: the terrain and the steering template; AUTO follows it
tip-display-hsi = HSI
    .desc = Horizontal situation indicator: heading, bearing and distance to the waypoint
tip-display-ded = DED
    .desc = Data entry display: radio, steerpoint, target, time and fuel
tip-display-scope = Air picture
    .desc = The tracks around the site, twice a second; click one to select it
tip-display-board = Tracks / site
    .desc = Click a track to select it; the SITE tab: launchers and stocks
tip-display-eo = Camera
    .desc = The locked track (a drone command center: the selected drone's camera), in colour or thermal (FLIR)
tip-display-info = Target data
    .desc = The locked track: range, altitude, speed, time of flight (a drone command center: its drones in the air and their batteries)
tip-display-feed = Drone camera
    .desc = The selected drone's camera: its TGP (the stick slews it) or the forward FLIR, its speed, height and heading
tip-display-map = Ground control station
    .desc = The drones and the contacts: drag to pan, click a drone to select it, drag its waypoints; NEW DRONE plans a launch
tip-stick = Side stick
    .desc = Pitch and roll
tip-console-stick = Hand controller
    .desc = Without a lock: slews the gun and the camera; the trigger fires
tip-throttle = Throttle
    .desc = Thrust
tip-nozzle-lever = Nozzle lever
    .desc = Forward: nozzles aft; back: down, to the hover stop (90°) and the braking stop (98.5°)
tip-display-scratchpad = Scratchpad
    .desc = Keyboard display: radio, steerpoint, target, time and fuel
tip-display-lmpd = Left MPD
    .desc = Threats: radars at their range and bearing, missile envelopes, our radar return (inside the dashed ring: unseen) and its last 30 s; warnings (red), cautions (amber), advisories (green) flash until the master caution
tip-display-rmpd = Right MPD
    .desc = Engines: rotor speed, torque, temperatures, oil, fuel and fuel flow
